{"title":"2005 Pan African MO","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>2005 Pan African MO</b> problems and solutions.  The first link contains the full set of test problems. The rest contain each individual problem and its solution.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Pan_African_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2005 Pan African MO Problems (page does not exist)\">2005 Pan African MO Problems</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 1\">2005 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2005 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">2005 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2005 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">2005 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2005 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">2005 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2005 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">2005 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2005 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">2005 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 6</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Pan_African_MO&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://pamo-official.org/problemes/PAMO_2005_Problems_En.pdf\">Source of Problems</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2005 Pan African MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Pan_African_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2005 Pan African MO Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Pan_African_MO\" title=\"2004 Pan African MO\">2004 Pan African MO</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2005 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2005 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2005 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2005 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5<